  "description": "Meet Domenico, a non-technical founder, who set out on a challenge to build and sell a SaaS in 30 days back in January 2022. Since then, Domenico has successfully sold 6 micro-saas projects for $60K, scaled Softgen from $20K to $500K ARR, and sold it for over $1M. In this video, Domenico will share his playbook for building and selling micro-SaaS projects.\n\n🛠️ Want to build your own app with AI? Check out Starter Story Build → https://build.starterstory.com/build/ai-build-accelerator?utm_source=youtube&utm_campaign=domenico\n\nWhat Dom's working on right now: https://www.kortix.ai/\nFollow Dom: https://www.linkedin.com/in/domenicogagliardi/\n\n🔔 Follow the Second Channel: ‪@StarterStoryBuild‬ \n🏁 We're hiring: starterstory.com/jobs\n\nChapters:\n0:00 - Intro\n0:55 - Who is Domenico\n1:17 - Dom's background\n2:06 - Build-and-sell challenge\n4:12 - Dom's build-and-sell framework\n6:39 - What makes apps successful\n7:10 - Building while working 9 to 5\n7:59 - Tech stack\n8:53 - Dom's next step\n9:16 - Dom's advice to entrepreneurs\n10:20 - The final word\n\nThis video is an educational case study of one founder’s experience. It is not financial advice and does not guarantee any income or results. Every business is different and your results may vary.",
